(14555,'zhCN','<野猪人用他闪亮的黑眼珠丁盯着你看。>',NULL,'<The quilboar wrinkles his nose at you and snorts.>',NULL,'What now, $r? Do your worst.',NULL,'We\'re warriors, $n. <Snort> Many and proud.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
