(16099,'zhCN','士气越来越高了，谢谢你的努力，$c。',NULL,'If we find a way to fight our way out of here, Hellscream will know of your deeds, $r.',NULL,'These orcs and I have served together through many battles.$b$bI do not envy any naga that enters this place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(16100,'frFR',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
