(16763,'zhCN','<Grunt>$b$bYou need something, $r?','<哼>$b$b你需要什么吗，$r?','What is it?  I\'m a little busy here.','What is it?  I\'m a little busy here.','I\'m training right now.  Can this wait?','I\'m training right now.  Can this wait?','Yes?','Yes?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
