(16881,'zhCN','Hey, it ain\'t MY fault ya didn\'t learn proper spellcraft.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGo pester a $c trainer, yeah?','嘿，你学不会法术又不是「我」的错。\r\n\r\n找个$c训练师去烦，好吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
