(17759,'zhCN','To reach the Rut\'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut\'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.','想要找到鲁瑟兰码头，你得先去达纳苏斯，通过传送门进入鲁瑟兰村。','If you wish to use a hippogryph, speak with Fidelio.','If you wish to use a hippogryph, speak with Fidelio.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
